252},"What are Digital Twins?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhat-are-digital-twins","blog\u002FWhat are Digital Twins",{"title":254,"path":255,"stem":256},"What makes Mixed Reality the next big thing?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhat-makes-mixed-reality-the-next-big-thing","blog\u002FWhat makes Mixed Reality the next big thing",{"title":258,"path":259,"stem":260},"Why Game Engines?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhy-game-engines","blog\u002FWhy Game Engines",{"title":262,"path":263,"stem":264},"Why we need User Experience Design?","\u002Fblog\u002Fwhy-we-need-user-experience-design","blog\u002FWhy we need User Experience Design",false,{"id":267,"title":54,"author":268,"body":272,"date":419,"description":420,"extension":421,"image":422,"meta":423,"minRead":424,"navigation":425,"path":55,"seo":426,"stem":56,"__hash__":427},"blog\u002Fblog\u002FComputational Fluid Dynamics.md",{"name":269,"avatar":270},"Aghil Jose",{"src":271,"alt":269},"\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fabout.webp",{"type":273,"value":274,"toc":408},"minimark",[275,279,282,285,307,310,315,332,336,353,356,367,370,374,377,381,384,388,391,395,398,402,405],[276,277,278],"p",{},"Computational Fluid Dynamics (CFD) provides a qualitative prediction of fluid\nflows by means of mathematical modelling, numerical methods and software\ntools. CFD enables scientists and engineers to perform numerical experiments\n(i.e., computer simulations) in a virtual flow laboratory.",[276,280,281],{},"**So, why make use of this technology?",[276,283,284],{},"Computational fluid dynamics and numerical simulations will help:",[286,287,288,292,295,298,301,304],"ul",{},[289,290,291],"li",{},"Architects to design comfortable and safe living environments.",[289,293,294],{},"Designers of vehicles to improve the aerodynamic characteristics.",[289,296,297],{},"Chemical engineers to maximize the yield from their equipment.",[289,299,300],{},"Surgeons to cure arterial diseases (computational hemodynamics).",[289,302,303],{},"Meteorologists to forecast the weather and warn of natural disasters.",[289,305,306],{},"Safety experts to reduce health risks from radiation and other hazards.",[276,308,309],{},"To be clear, CFD does not replace the measurements completely and it is\nlikely to remain that way for some time. But, the amount of experimentation\nand the overall cost can be significantly reduced. Let us consider the\ndifferences between experiments and simulations.",[311,312,314],"h2",{"id":313},"experiments","Experiments",[286,316,317,320,323,326,329],{},[289,318,319],{},"Expensive.",[289,321,322],{},"Sequential.",[289,324,325],{},"Single-purpose.",[289,327,328],{},"Difficult to transport.",[289,330,331],{},"Slow.",[311,333,335],{"id":334},"simulations","Simulations",[286,337,338,341,344,347,350],{},[289,339,340],{},"Cheaper.",[289,342,343],{},"Parallel.",[289,345,346],{},"Multi-purpose.",[289,348,349],{},"Portable.",[289,351,352],{},"Faster.",[276,354,355],{},"We should also keep in mind that the results of CFD simulations are not yet\n100% accurate. These are because of the following reasons:",[286,357,358,361,364],{},[289,359,360],{},"The input data may involve too much guessing and might not be precise.",[289,362,363],{},"The accuracy of the results will depend on available computing power.",[289,365,366],{},"The mathematical model of the problem at hand might be inadequate.",[276,368,369],{},"CFD uses a computer to solve the mathematical equations for the problem at\nhand. The main components of a CFD process includes the following:",[311,371,373],{"id":372},"_1-human-beings","1. Human beings",[276,375,376],{},"An analyst or analysts, who states the problem to be solved. Another human\nbeing or human beings, will also be involved to inspect and interpret the\nsimulations results. The one who states the problem and the one who inspect\nand interpret the results should not necessarily be different person.",[311,378,380],{"id":379},"_2-scientific-knowledge","2. Scientific knowledge",[276,382,383],{},"The models and methods which are expressed mathematically.",[311,385,387],{"id":386},"_3-software","3. Software",[276,389,390],{},"The computer code which embodies the scientific knowledge and provides\ndetailed algorithms for the solution.",[311,392,394],{"id":393},"_4-hardware","4. Hardware",[276,396,397],{},"The physical computer hardwares which will perform the actual calculations.",[311,399,401],{"id":400},"cfd-is-a-highly-interdisciplinary-research-area-which-lies-at-the-interface","CFD is a highly interdisciplinary research area which lies at the interface",[276,403,404],{},"of physics, applied mathematics and computer science.",[276,406,407],{},"Disclaimer : The views and opinions expressed in the article belong solely to\nthe author, and not necessarily to the author's employer, organisation,\ncommittee or other group or individual.",{"title":409,"searchDepth":410,"depth":410,"links":411},"",2,[412,413,414,415,416,417,418],{"id":313,"depth":410,"text":314},{"id":334,"depth":410,"text":335},{"id":372,"depth":410,"text":373},{"id":379,"depth":410,"text":380},{"id":386,"depth":410,"text":387},{"id":393,"depth":410,"text":394},{"id":400,"depth":410,"text":401},"2021-03-27","CFD Simulations and its advatanges of classical experiments.","md","\u002Fassets\u002Fimages\u002Fblog\u002F290321\u002Ftitle.webp",{},3,true,{"title":54,"description":420},"KhaL2HQXkjhf3K7-aN1Dd-EOwA7lHL-XE7_FT6bGTEI",[429,432],{"path":27,"title":26,"description":430,"date":431},"A year of blogs, reading and the pandemic.","2021-04-06",{"path":195,"title":194,"description":433,"date":434},"The method and advantages of using multiple sensors together.","2021-03-21",1790338182927]